# Services layer

Detail: [docs/11-services-migration.md](../docs/11-services-migration.md), [docs/04-feature-module.md](../docs/04-feature-module.md)

## Placement

| Layer | Path | Responsibility |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Feature API | `features/<name>/services/*.service.ts` | Feature HTTP calls, DTO mapping |
| Shared infra | `core/services/*.ts` | Base URL, auth headers, shared clients |
| Low-level client | `core/lib/api-client.ts` | Fetch wrapper — **used by services**, not components |

## Rules

- ❌ `fetch` / `apiClient` directly in `*.tsx` components (pages, feature UI)
- ❌ Business HTTP logic duplicated inside Server Actions
- ✅ Services export typed functions (`getUsers`, `createUser`, …)
- ✅ Server Actions: Zod validate → call service → `revalidatePath` / `redirect`
- ✅ Client hooks: TanStack Query `queryFn` calls service (server) or thin server-action wrapper

## Naming

- Files: `kebab-case.service.ts` (e.g. `user.service.ts`)
- Functions: verb + noun (`getUsers`, `updateUserById`)

## Import boundaries

- Services may import from `core/`, `@repo/api`
- Services must **not** import from `features/<other>/` or React
